Package: gamenight
Title: Find Board Games for Your Game Night 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Noor Fatima", "Moolji", , "nmoo0016@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a cleaned dataset of BoardGameGeek board games with
    ratings, player counts, playing times and suggested ages, a function
    for finding well-rated games that suit a group, and a Shiny app for
    exploring how much playing time is needed to get a highly rated game.
